20px;font-weight:700;\">视频教程</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\">\n                      <p class=\"video-title\">往期翻牌活动教程（流程不变）</p>\n                      <div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/13/3C/ChpCl12MjCCEQOH5AAAAAJ3C1H8813.png\" data-url=\"<iframe src=&quot;//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=255687449&amp;bvid=BV1jY411j7in&amp;cid=576015251&amp;page=1&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; frameborder=&quot;no&quot; framespacing=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;> </iframe>\" data-video-id=\"\" tag=\"\" data-title=\"往期翻牌活动教程（流程不变）\" data-video_url=\"\" data-isb=\"2\" data-is_hot=\"0\" data-width=\"804\" data-height=\"451\">\n                     <i class=\"icon-video-play\"></i>\n                      </div>\n                    </div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"\">活动主要目的</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">通过活动剧情本来获取活动特殊积分（难度越高，积分获取更多），期间可挂机在你能打到稳定获取⭐⭐⭐评价最高难度，⭐⭐⭐评价可获取三次翻取奖励的机会，在翻牌中可获取积分、金币、玛瑙等物，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">主要获取道具为装备道具的强化石和魂卡的强化枕头</span>（4星以上）。（<span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">全游最稳定获取强化石和强化枕头的途径，为3倍附魔打下基础</span>）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">每当把Main项的道具获取就能刷新整个道具版面刷新（无限），或者把版面的道具搬空后自动刷新，再或者拿取Main道具可以刷新后留下继续获取目标道具后再手动刷新。</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">本期攻略（8-4）</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">本期H8正常战斗常驻队伍</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158051120_1145477.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158051120_1145477.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161727246_24584525.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161727246_24584525.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161687886_19227882.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/16