.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;\"></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">遭遇战：</span>特别Boss 卡内莎</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/85574.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/85574.png\" data-width=\"1400\" data-height=\"1050\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 225px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">击败特别Boss提供幸运奖励+1枚翻牌</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><br></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">翻牌ND自选箱建议</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-v-d052db34=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">萌新首选，PvE、PvP两开花，皮肤塔、星云、地狱开荒请带上</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-v-d052db34=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535885910_22583866.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535885910_22583866.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PvE实用度一般，PvP老手向（不是定向解控，新手老老实实用嫦娥吧）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-v-d052db34=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158388911_27886656.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158388911_27886656.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PvE实用度一般，PvP一霸（没点火前什么都不是，新手劝退）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161713954_23670040.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161713954_23670040.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">技能翻新变得更好用了，现阶段地狱攻略中坚（本期08-04可选加值增幅积分）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">XP玩家任选</span></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">收益比较（30%、无）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">40车，无增益（1000体力获取2.5w积分）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/97276.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/97276.jpg\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2400\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 666px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">40车，30%增益（1000体力获取3.8w积分）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/228922.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/228922.jpg\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2400\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 666px;\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">80%增幅，1000车H8</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/17/553585.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/17/553585.jpg\" data-width=\"884\" data-height=\"1032\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 350px;\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">请自行脑补差距</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">小贴士</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span><span style=\"\"></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">翻牌活动积分可被增幅，增幅天子为本次活动的天子和一个旧天子。初始增幅为30%，当提高天子加值和点火时可提高增幅比例。<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\">不到60%增幅适当放弃活动</span></span>&nbsp;（翻牌自选有1个再抽一个凑60%）</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">关于体力：活动会消耗大量体力，体力没有了可在游戏主页的金币道具箱里随机抽到，1000w金币大约能抽到1w左右体力，并且抽到的道具还可以卖掉换金币</div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">参与度提示</span></span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">没到60%增益建议忽略</span>（两个天子都没有就没必要抽了），只拿<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">最低7个藏品奖励</span><br></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">如果你有旧天子并想冲一下附魔石，那就抽吧<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;\">（翻牌自选有1个再抽一个凑60%）</span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">当期增益 30%，加值每增加1，提高5%，最高60%</span></span><br><div><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/107851/2022/6/14/608129.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/107851/2022/6/14/608129.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">旧天子 30%，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">加值每增加1，提高5%，最高60%</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><img data-v-3d3358c3=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161713954_23670040.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161713954_23670040.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;width:80px;height:80px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">藏品奖励，最后一项为无限刷新的1个冰西瓜</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/13/3C/ChpCl12MjCCEQOH5AAAAAJ3C1H8813.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1280/h_1280/1069/107851/2022/7/4/994936.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/14/165924.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "萌新之友，已重开，真萌新", "follow_num": 1413, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "夏日蓝调", "tag_color": "#00B0F0"}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 3, "content_at": 65872669, "content_num": 239, "read_num": 5044844, "like_num": 3644}, "update_user": {"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "萌新之友，已重开，真萌新", "follow_num": 1413, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 3, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 1672